{"id":"n39326-1-9","stage":4,"title":"나그네 · 旅人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39326-1-9-1","ko":"지나가는 나그네인데 물 한 잔만 얻어 마실 수 있을까요?","zh":"我是路过的旅人，能请您给我一杯水喝吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지나가는","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나그네인데","meaning":"旅人，过客","explanation":"나그네：旅人，过客；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"나그네","audio":"/audio/734c4471a0b2049933aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39326","senseId":"1","lemma":"나그네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔만","meaning":"杯","explanation":"잔：杯；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"3","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얻어","meaning":"得到，获取，获得，取得","explanation":"얻다：得到，获取，获得，取得；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"얻다","audio":"/audio/e9a48e141ad07674b586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73863","senseId":"6","lemma":"얻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마실","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"通过，路过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"经过某个地方。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"734c4471a0b20499","term":"나그네","zh":"旅人，过客","audio":"/audio/734c4471a0b2049933aa.mp3","entryId":"39326","definition":"离家旅行或四处游走的人。","pronunciation":["나그네"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"以盛饮料、酒等的器具为标准，数其数量的单位。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"e9a48e141ad07674","term":"얻다","zh":"得到，获取，获得，取得","audio":"/audio/e9a48e141ad07674b586.mp3","entryId":"73863","definition":"占据或拿到权利、结果、财产等。","pronunciation":["얻ː따"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d3ebd07df69be7e2ff9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n39326-1-9-2","ko":"그럼요. 잠시만 기다리세요.","zh":"当然可以。请稍等片刻。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼요.","meaning":"当然、那是当然","explanation":"그럼요：当然、那是当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼요","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:그럼요:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼요","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"잠시만","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리세요.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ef69d4f567549e5e","term":"그럼요","zh":"当然、那是当然","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3","definition":"礼貌地肯定对方的问题或说法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/779a747a02197c80da6b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.855,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=39326","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6817,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当然可以。请稍等片刻。","我是路过的旅人，能请您给我一杯水喝吗？","你从家里去学校的时候坐什么来？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我是路过的旅人，能请您给我一杯水喝吗？","你从家里去学校的时候坐什么来？","当然可以。请稍等片刻。"],"answer":2}]}
